Package: aiqcreport
Title: Shared Machinery for the AIQC In Situ Summary Reports
Version: 0.1.0
Authors@R: person("Takaya", "Saito", email = "takaya.saito@hi.no", role = c("aut", "cre"))
Description: Functions and knitr templates shared by the regional CTD
    data-summary sites (arc-report, bal-report, med-report). Each site keeps
    only its region constants and its pages.
